# No required environment variables — the app uses entirely free,
# keyless services:
# - Story / converse text → Pollinations text (text.pollinations.ai)
# - Cover image → Pollinations image (image.pollinations.ai)
# - Narration → browser speechSynthesis (runs locally on device)
#
# Optional override: pick a different Pollinations model.
# Common values: openai (default, GPT-class), mistral, llama, deepseek, gemini.

# STORY_MODEL=openai
